---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Surrey Neurotech Society exists to demystify neurotechnology. We bring together students from all degrees to explore the human mind.">

  <!-- Hero / Society Story -->
  <section class="bg-slate-50 py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 relative overflow-hidden flow-section">
    <!-- Soft abstract flowing background -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-30">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-[10%] w-[60vw] h-[60vw] bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-[10%] left-[10%] w-[50vw] h-[50vw] bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-[80px]"></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl relative z-10 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-8">Demystifying Neurotechnology.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-light">
        We believe the intersection of the human mind and technology is too important to be kept behind closed doors. We're a student-led community dedicated to making neuroscience, BCIs, and AI accessible to everyone.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who We Are -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-white border-t border-slate-200">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-16">
        <div class="flex-1 text-center md:text-left">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Who We Are</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            We are a vibrant mix of psychology, computer science, biomedical engineering, and arts students. You don't need a medical degree or programming experience to join us.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            What unites us is a shared curiosity about how the brain works and how we can build technologies that interface with it responsibly.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex-1 w-full flex justify-center">
           <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 w-full max-w-md">
              <div class="bg-cyan-50 rounded-3xl p-8 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center aspect-square shadow-sm">
                 <span class="text-4xl mb-4">🧠</span>
                 <span class="font-bold text-slate-900">Psychology & Biosciences</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-3xl p-8 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center aspect-square shadow-sm translate-y-8">
                 <span class="text-4xl mb-4">💻</span>
                 <span class="font-bold text-slate-900">Computing & Engineering</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-100 rounded-3xl p-8 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center aspect-square shadow-sm col-span-2 mt-4">
                 <span class="text-3xl mb-2">🤝</span>
                 <span class="font-bold text-slate-900">Everyone Else</span>
                 <span class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2">Arts, Humanities, Business, and more.</span>
              </div>
           </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Vision & Ethics -->
  <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-24 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Ambient light blobs -->
    <div class="absolute top-[20%] right-[-10%] w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] left-[20%] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
         <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">Our Vision & Ethics</h2>
         <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Building a responsible future for neurotechnology.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16">
        <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-10 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-md">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
             <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Human-Centred Design</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            We focus on how technology can support and enhance human wellbeing. We explore neurotechnology not just for the sake of innovation, but to understand its profound impact on accessibility, mental health, and daily life.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-10 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-md">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
             <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Cognitive Privacy</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            With the ability to decode brain signals comes immense responsibility. We prioritize discussions around data rights, consent, and the ethical boundaries of reading the human mind. Responsible innovation is our core philosophy.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
